# Stray electron-vite / Vite 8 dumps at repo root. Real bundles live in
# out/main/ (package.json `main` → out/main/index.js). Vite 8+rolldown has
# been seen writing named entries and hashed chunks next to cwd as well.
/index.js
/main.js
/server-runtime.js
/host-runtime.js
/host-child.js
/*-*.js
/chunks/
